Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:04.02,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Charles Arbor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:07.44,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That's who Professor Celia is marrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.44,0:00:11.28,main,researcher,0,0,0,,Well, it is your quintessential \Nmarriage of convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.03,main,Rio,0,0,0,,By which you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.90,main,researcher,0,0,0,,In the last conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.90,0:00:19.04,main,researcher,0,0,0,,the Kingdom of Beltrum suffered a \Ncrushing defeat by the Proxia Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:22.10,main,researcher,0,0,0,,Thanks to the actions of \Nthe House of Duke Arbor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:25.68,main,researcher,0,0,0,,we just barely managed to \Ncommence negotiations for peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:27.99,main,researcher,0,0,0,,but the power and authority \Nof the royal family was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.56,0:00:31.37,main,researcher,0,0,0,,When Duke Huguenot's faction was \Nmade to take responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.05,main,researcher,0,0,0,,they fled the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.20,main,researcher,0,0,0,,The House of Duke Arbor has \Nrallied their momentum,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:40.18,main,researcher,0,0,0,,and what they have chosen in \Norder to once more gain strength
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.18,0:00:42.95,main,researcher,0,0,0,,is the House of Count Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.95,0:00:48.86,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Does Professor Celia... no, does the House of \NCount Claire desire this political marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.69,main,researcher,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:53.41,main,researcher,0,0,0,,I don't have such detailed information.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.69,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,What will you do, Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:04.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,The wedding ceremony is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:08.40,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Before it happens, I want to see \NProfessor Celia and ask her in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.89,0:01:09.67,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:12.90,main,Rio,0,0,0,,But the professor is in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.90,0:01:16.56,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Their defenses will be even \Ntighter than the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:19.75,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Then I'll use my spirit form and investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.75,0:01:23.14,main,Rio,0,0,0,,A spirit in spirit form is \Na mass of od and mana...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:26.75,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Something inside the castle may be set \Nto detect suspicious magical power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:28.54,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Will you be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.95,0:01:31.73,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,I can visually perceive barriers \Nthat are made to detect magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.73,0:01:33.09,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.09,0:01:35.19,main,Rio,0,0,0,,O-Oh, but Aishia, you and \Nthe professor haven't—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:37.15,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,I know what Celia looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.84,0:01:39.12,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.38,0:01:40.93,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Yes, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.01,0:02:03.18,sign_3238_18_Seirei_Gensouki,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(345,125)\blur4\fad(897,1)}Seirei Gensouki
